<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli settlers are carrying out arson attacks on Palestinian villages in the West Bank, with graffiti accompanying the fires in five villages. Defense Minister Gadi Eisenkot condemned the attacks as &amp;quot;Jewish terrorism&amp;quot; and invited Prime Minister Netanyahu's Likud party to marathon coalition talks. In Gaza, Israeli airstrikes continue to hit aid vehicles, killing three people while the IDF says the targets were terror operatives. The conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/israel-investigates-west-bank-fires&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168836&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261121-eisenkot-invites-netanyahu-s-party-for-marathon-israeli-coalition-talks&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOSFFzSVdYalBSdDlqbWZ6YWdRcF90Tmd2bjNKQjd4WkJrQkY2YkNScHZaNDcyY2YxYWxocmFCaTlhaTFHVTdmVUhpcDV6R2cyOUEtb2E0RnplUDR0dEcyLXdJOEZPbUxBZUd4akxyem1ITGhFWWV2akVadkRyLVdGdWtQbFh0Uk45OGYtTllWR2lZWW8yV3ZoVWQ5RDVEUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/22/west-bank-four-palestinian-villages-targeted-in-suspected-settler-attacks&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOTXlIQXI1U3MxbFh5Z1oycXU4LU1reGMyU2dXSHNabVI2MExNZDhSZzVoNlM1eVR6bHpiU2twMk16dFNNR09YVGhLOGZTYnN2bk44WWlmWTBaLXN0ODBFLXFualNOTWNwaWhJdGJvU20zaEUxbVpQNXo5OXN1T0JwTkdNeUJEOTZ3YXlmTUJUbFliSzZmZXlDOFMtNU1RbGtQQnZIWXROUE1hZldMeUg4UmRmQS14Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOZm9CNGQyVU1MUXlCUFdFdkthV0RVUDZBSzFvTGJDSl